"Touchpad Share gestus auditoris constitutus (status activus in hoc ambitu "
"non verificatus)."

#: lib/install-components.sh:420
msgid "Touchpad Share gesture listener installed and active."
msgstr "Touchpad Share gestus auditoris inauguratus et industrius."

